        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p data-start=&quot;108&quot; data-end=&quot;174&quot;&gt;There’s no such thing as a secret in Stewiacke, Nova Scotia – the halfway point between the Equator and North Pole - especially when four best friends meet for coffee every day to share gossip, romance, bawdy tales, and the true meaning of life. When a new doctor from Toronto takes a temporary job at the clinic and becomes interested in a local waitress, the Maritime town is turned upside down. A raucously funny comedy about the unshakeable bonds of friendship and the messiness of love.&lt;/p&gt;"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Halfway There - A hilarious tale of friendship, gossip, and love in small-town Nova Scotia."
      }
    ],
