        "@value": "Michael Harrison – Ventriloquist and Comedian - Manluk Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Get ready to laugh out loud! Comedian and ventriloquist Michael Harrison brings a high-energy, side-splitting show that's just as hilarious for adults as it is for kids. With quick wit, clever puppets, and unexpected twists, it's a family-friendly comedy experience you won't want to miss!"
      }
