        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "1920’s Gala - Manluk Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A Night of Timeless Glamour — The 1920s themed Manluk Theatre Annual Gala Step back into the roaring 1920s for an unforgettable evening of music, elegance, and celebration. Join us in your finest flapper dresses, fedoras, and vintage glamour as the sensational Battle River Big Band—an 18-piece big band—fills the room with the bold, brassy sounds"
      }
    ],
