        "@value": "A singer/songwriter, Veteran soldier, and gifted storyteller, Tim invites you to explore our fascinating history based on his acclaimed third album \"Prairie Fire.\" Featuring original story songs that breathe life into the captivating tales of events and characters of the 19th century Canadian Prairies."
