    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This rural Alberta based Comedian has performed in comedy clubs across Canada and has entertained the troops in the middle east. Don&#039;t miss the laughs as he makes his debut on the Manluk stage!    &quot;Ken was already headlining clubs when I first started. He was killing me then, and he kills me now.&quot;    -Brent Butt    &quot;Easily the funniest comedian I&#039;ve ever seen!&quot;    -Ken Mastel    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    ADVERTISING: The Purchaser agrees to post a picture and bio of the PERFORMER(S) on any website advertising the event if    doing so and link it to CCEI website page. Purchaser agrees to put on all printed material including but not limited to posters,    flyers, programs “Entertainment supplied by CallBack Corporate Entertainment Inc.” Please contact CCEI for picture &amp; bio of the    performer(s) if required"
      }
    ],
