        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Spandy Andy - Manluk Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Zany dance moves, a quirky personality, and a giant balloon! His shows serve as a delightful reminder that embracing one's self-worth is the key to a fulfilling and empowered life. Get ready to laugh and learn as Spandy Andy uses the power of positivity to teach the importance of self-esteem."
      }
    ],
