        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A BUDDY HOLLY GALA - Manluk Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us at the Manluk Theatre for our third annual season launch gala, this year featuring a tribute to the prince of rock and roll, the great BUDDY HOLLY. The theme of the night is 50’s, so feel free to break out your leather jackets, poodle skirts, jeans, t-shirts, cats-eye glasses, and bee-hive hair-dos! There"
      }
