      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join us at the Manluk Theatre for our third annual season launch gala, this year featuring a tribute to the prince of rock and roll, the great BUDDY HOLLY.  The theme of the night is 50’s, so feel free to break out your leather jackets, poodle skirts, jeans, t-shirts, cats-eye glasses, and bee-hive hair-dos! There will be food and fun with many exciting prizes. We will also be revealing our 24-25 season which is to be our biggest and best yet! Our entertainer, Ken Mastel, has been performing his Buddy Holly show for many years and is well-known as an actor, singer, writer and director, and he does all of these in the tribute. He will leave you laughing and clapping and singing along. If you don’t know and love Buddy Holly, you will after seeing this show!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A BUDDY HOLLY GALA"
      }
    ],
