        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "From Darkness to Light – a Discussion on Grief with Margreet Van Jansen - Manluk Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join Margreet van Jansen as she talks about the most difficult time of her life - losing her only child and learning to live with grief. Is life possible after such devastation? Margreet talks about her personal journey through the darkness back to light. In life both darkness and light are always present – but"
      }
