      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Classic story of Robin hood by Tim Kelly, Directed by Miranda Hamer, re-imagined by the Manluk Youth Theatre group. Tickets are FREE for this event, with the option of making donations if you so choose."
      }
