    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join us as we launch our new season with a bang!    On September 23rd, we announce this seasons productions, with an exclusive show of our own.    &lt;em&gt;MURDER at the MANLUK&lt;/em&gt; will be shown only one time this year. Don&#039;t miss your chance to solve the mystery of whodunit.    and remember...    Love never dies.    September 23, 2023    7:00PM    Cocktails, Hors d&#039;oeuvres, Interactive murder mystery, Silent Auction, and Season Announcement"
      }
    ],
