    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Alberta musician, songwriter and multi-instrumentalist, Charlie Jacobson is bringing his own brand of blues to the people. Jacobson has backed up — and been backed by — Canadian blues giants, including Kenny “Blues Boss” Wayne, Russell Jackson, David Vest and Donald Ray Johnson. Charlie’s guitar appears to be part of his body when he’s on"
