    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This classic work faithfully recreates the magic and mystery of Aslan, the great lion, his struggle with the White Witch, and the adventures of four children who inadvertently wander from an old wardrobe into the exciting, never-to-be-forgotten Narnia.    This story of love, faith, courage and giving, with its triumph of good over evil, is a true celebration of life.    By C.S.LEWIS    Directed by Kaitlin Anderson"
      }
