        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Yuk Yuks never disappoints!! Get ready for a night of fun and laughter right here at the Manluk Theatre for the Performing Arts as we host Stand-up Comics on Tour with Yuk Yuks! Headliner MIKE DAMBRA A comedy staple across the United States and Canada, Mike is known as the smart ass king of comedy."
