    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Yuk Yuks never disappoints!!  Get ready for a night of fun and laughter right here at the Manluk Theatre for the Performing Arts as we host Stand-up Comics on Tour with Yuk Yuks!    Headliner MIKE DAMBRA  A comedy staple across the United States and Canada, Mike is known as the smart ass king of comedy. His interactive style has earned him rave reviews in every venue and festival he&#039;s played in. Mike has worked with acts from Mick Foley to Michael Bolton, Adam Sandler to Jim Brewer, Rosie O&#039;Donnell to Paul Reiser. The Calgary Sun says, &quot;Brush up on your sit-ups before you see this show, otherwise your stomach muscles will hurt the next day!&quot;    MC RYAN ASH  Ryan Ash is a Canadian comedian who’s been called “uncommonly well-written” by the Edmonton Journal and a “tour-de-force” by CBC.ca. He’s been seen at the Winnipeg Comedy Festival 9 times, heard on Sirius XM and seen in TV/Film for companies like Fox, NBC, and Sony.      Supporting Act ELISIA SNYDER  Elisia Snyder is one of Western Canada’s fastest-rising comedic talents. She has recently showcased for the JUST FOR LAUGHS Festival. Elisia’s comedy is quick, cutting, and always exciting."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "YUK YUKS On Tour"
      }
    ],
