    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Do you think Grease is the word? Then you are now ready for  &quot;BEAR GREASE&quot;.  This show is a hilarious, indigenous twist on the 1978 classic &quot;Grease&quot;.  It features an all indigenous cast who will share their reimagining of the beloved musical by making it culturallly relevant with hints of Indigenous Humor and Pride. You don&#039;t want to miss this one-of-a-kind theatrical performance that has been gaining traction across Canada and North America. Come with your singing voices ready to rock and roll for this night of indigenized Musical Theatre.  And dress in your best 50s outfit.    The art of inclusion.  BEAR GREASE is the type of theatre show that would draw tourists and inspire many.  In a market that is over-saturated with everyone doing the same thing, Hip Hop Duo LightningCloud has evolved and reinvented itself to create a first class musical with award winning Actors and Musicians.     Written on the Enoch Cree Nation in Treaty 6 Edmonton, Alberta by Hip Hop Duo &quot;LightningCloud&quot;,  BEAR GREASE is  ready to take over Broadway!       BEAR GREASE has SOLD OUT theatres across Edmonton, Calgary (and a USA tour including Colorado, Las Vegas and California)."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "BEAR GREASE"
      }
    ],
