    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p class=&quot;m8h3af8h l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf&quot;&gt;In the documentary film &quot;The Wisdom of Trauma&quot;, we travel alongside physician, bestselling author and Order of Canada recipient Dr. Gabor Mate to explore why western society is facing epidemics of anxiety, chronic illness and substance abuse.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=&quot;m8h3af8h l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf&quot;&gt;This is a journey with a man who has dedicated his life to understanding the connection between illness, addiction, trauma and society.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;  &lt;pre class=&quot;elementor-blockquote__content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;“Trauma is not what happens to you.&lt;/strong&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Trauma is what happens inside you, as a result of what happens to you.”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;  &lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;cite class=&quot;elementor-blockquote__author&quot;&gt;— Gabor Maté&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz&quot;&gt;Dr. Mate&#039;s books include &quot;When the Body Says No: Understanding the Stress-Disease Connection&quot;, &quot;In the Realm of Hungry Ghosts: Close Encounters with Addiction&quot; and the soon to be released &quot;The Myth of Normal: Trauma, Illness and Healing in a Toxic Culture&quot;.&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;** Only 100 tickets are available for this event**&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;m8h3af8h l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf n3t5jt4f&quot;&gt;  &lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please join us Wednesday, September 14 - 7 pm at the Manluk Theatre for the Performing Arts as Wetaskiwin FCSS presents a community screening of &quot;The Wisdom of Trauma&quot; featuring the work of renowned physician, speaker, best-selling author and Order of Canada recipient, Dr. Gabor Mate.&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f&quot;&gt;  &lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;    Dr. Mate is highly sought after for his expertise on addiction, trauma and childhood development and the relationship of stress and illness. &lt;a class=&quot;qi72231t nu7423ey n3hqoq4p r86q59rh b3qcqh3k fq87ekyn bdao358l fsf7x5fv rse6dlih s5oniofx m8h3af8h l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk srn514ro oxkhqvkx rl78xhln nch0832m cr00lzj9 rn8ck1ys s3jn8y49 icdlwmnq cxfqmxzd ezidihy3&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://drgabormate.com/?fbclid=IwAR2m57A4aOr_B51qLZDAUdDqLTn0ej8uXYBPZdC8FHtkznIzuEQFz4FJGb8&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://drgabormate.com/&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f&quot;&gt;  &lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;    Tickets are limited and the price is by choice of donation level and is a Fundraiser for &quot;MOMS STOP THE HARM&quot;  &lt;h5 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ff0000;&quot;&gt;This event is a Fundraiser for &quot;Moms Stop the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ff0000;&quot;&gt;Ha&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ff0000;&quot;&gt;rm&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;  &lt;h5 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;TCImage&quot; style=&quot;width: 98px; padding: 5px; margin: 5px auto; display: block; border: 0px solid #cccccc;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.ticketor.net/usercontent/1173/rte/024db111-dbe2-4aed-ad78-210b07ae5764.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;  &lt;h5 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Moms Stop the Harm (MSTH) is a network of Canadian families impacted by substance-use-related harms and deaths.&lt;/h5&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f&quot;&gt;  &lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You can buy your tickets online at:   &lt;a class=&quot;qi72231t nu7423ey n3hqoq4p r86q59rh b3qcqh3k fq87ekyn bdao358l fsf7x5fv rse6dlih s5oniofx m8h3af8h l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk srn514ro oxkhqvkx rl78xhln nch0832m cr00lzj9 rn8ck1ys s3jn8y49 icdlwmnq cxfqmxzd ezidihy3&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticketor.com%2Fwetaskiwintheatresociety%2Fupcomingevents%3Fpageid%3D4138%26fbclid%3DIwAR0gr0knPGQkOd50Mz3ECqHrf7Y5pUrBVmOZXYC9Kx1n4lEOCI-TQMEg5SQ&amp;h=AT2PKSPCQMhKT3QyhbM0tZ2T9z0FVzKz4lcKnh6ZlJp4M5aiil1qgGVCdJtXN_xM00n5FGktn57O-6EsnWO19VAlejhSMKlwq5b9r8AHDAIuQP989b7yV8FMkzEXGBmRUFr9&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT0d8_CekdUVBen3ei75qSfIrITJn1ueqrV5zwnngbsVNfiy3iSBR6N3XPA6LudpG9B1V0CuZXx-6wKCk566_hAg6ehdcSOLd2kpbr0ZlJ3yvgFnviXg00Ur4HqER7Br_gWqDVJoNpksWV-x3lrbvgaeJ9Dn91DqsqQlnRV9B4wG6yrkduezHB9h3MlsPbiiz5gKQxY1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://www.ticketor.com/wetaskiwinthea.../upcomingevents...&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Doors open at 6:30 pm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f&quot;&gt;  &lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Turning Point Society will be onsite offering naloxone training to those interested. Learn more about them here: &lt;a class=&quot;qi72231t nu7423ey n3hqoq4p r86q59rh b3qcqh3k fq87ekyn bdao358l fsf7x5fv rse6dlih s5oniofx m8h3af8h l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk srn514ro oxkhqvkx rl78xhln nch0832m cr00lzj9 rn8ck1ys s3jn8y49 icdlwmnq cxfqmxzd ezidihy3&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://turningpoint-ca.org/?fbclid=IwAR0cS-uogKGEYJ5S9XeeyBiX2_kTbfKVTLX0lLuqqTCc7g0zGd5mChtKtV4&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://turningpoint-ca.org/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-7421fd2 elementor-blockquote--skin-clean elementor-blockquote--align-center elementor-blockquote--button-color-official elementor-widget elementor-widget-blockquote&quot; data-id=&quot;7421fd2&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;blockquote.default&quot;&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;  &lt;blockquote class=&quot;elementor-blockquote&quot;&gt;  &lt;pre class=&quot;elementor-blockquote__content&quot;&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;  &lt;/blockquote&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;"
      }
